      <p>  <p>Gets the <a href="http://json.org" target="_blank">JSON</a> type for the value in <b>json</b> at the location <b>specifiers</b>.</p>
  <p>Returns the string specifying the type of the value at <b>specifiers</b> in <b>json</b>.</p>
</p>
